Attack 1 — false negatives (ATTACK SURFACE, confirmed real but out of FAIL scope): wrote a probe
(TestProbeDP1_MissedPairs) enumerating same-account/same-cents Pending/Posted pairs NOT in the
paired set. Found genuine missed pending→posted dupes: Grammarly (-144.00, common prefix "grammarly"
